o your intuition is fair: **for the visible path itself, yes, the Telegram id seems irrelevant**.  \nBut for the backend request semantics, **it may still matter**, and I would **not remove it** unless we confirm the server truly ignores it.\n\nIf you want, I can do a safe diagnostic next:\n1. upload the same file once with `495506013`\n2. upload it again with a different dummy user id\n3. compare the raw responses\n\nThat would tell us whether `user_id` actually changes backend behavior.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_00fd6c95bd007ad00169bad7ec4fc481919476cd46aaa5f74e\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":274,"output":299,"cacheRead":56192,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":56765,"cost":{"input":0.0006850000000000001,"output":0.004485,"cacheRead":0.014048,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.019218}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773852650078}}
